  "description": "Bong Soo Ah, a heartbroken copywriter, meets a man at a nightclub who looks exactly like movie star Han Ji Hyuk. After a wild night, she wakes up in his hotel room—only to discover he’s the real Han Ji Hyuk! Can her life handle this unexpected twist?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_exclusive_wz), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3794513), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/50933888), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1286006661), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/1978), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=tn7y)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://dashtoon.com/comics/read/SHOczyInR9V0jmUXDjJ), [Thai](https://www.wecomics.in.th/comics/13581/), Spanish",
